msgstr "Производи и испорака"

#: inc/admin/guided-setup/guided-setup-fluid-checkout.php:172, inc/admin/guided-setup/guided-setup-fluid-checkout.php:1045
msgid "Recommended setup"
msgstr "Препорачано поставување"

#: inc/admin/guided-setup/guided-setup-fluid-checkout.php:419
msgid "Show recommendations already applied"
msgstr "Прикажи препораки што веќе се применети"

#: inc/admin/guided-setup/guided-setup-fluid-checkout.php:420
